        "rawMarkdown": "The microscope acquired multiple views of each volume, which were then fused.\nThere may be small intensity deviations between views, so they were linearly scaled to match a reference view.\nIn case you're interested, the microscope is custom-built and based on this design, https://www.janelia.org/sites/default/files/Library/Tomer%202012_0.pdf",
        "content": "<p>The microscope acquired multiple views of each volume, which were then fused.\nThere may be small intensity deviations between views, so they were linearly scaled to match a reference view.\nIn case you're interested, the microscope is custom-built and based on this design, <a href=\"https://www.janelia.org/sites/default/files/Library/Tomer%202012_0.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.janelia.org/sites/default/files/Library/Tomer%202012_0.pdf</a></p>",
